{"id":"n19620-1-7","stage":5,"title":"강우량 · 降雨量","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19620-1-7-1","ko":"앞으로 비가 얼마나 더 내릴 것으로 예측되나요?","zh":"预计接下来还会下多少雨？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내릴","meaning":"下，落","explanation":"내리다：下，落；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"1","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것으로","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예측되나요?","meaning":"被预测","explanation":"예측되다：被预测；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"예측되다","audio":"/audio/9f63b10121a323a2270a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70101","senseId":"1","lemma":"예측되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下，落","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"雪或雨等降下。","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"9f63b10121a323a2","term":"예측되다","zh":"被预测","audio":"/audio/9f63b10121a323a2270a.mp3","entryId":"70101","definition":"未来的事被提前推测。","pronunciation":["예ː측뙤다","예ː측뛔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e922875b386ec0bfeb9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n19620-1-7-2","ko":"예상 강우량은 서울 팔십 밀리미터가 되겠습니다.","zh":"首尔的预计降雨量为八十毫米。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예상","meaning":"预想","explanation":"예상：预想","readings":[{"term":"예상","audio":"/audio/d558732dc8ee759f5ce5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70522","senseId":"1","lemma":"예상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강우량은","meaning":"降雨量","explanation":"강우량：降雨量；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"강우량","audio":"/audio/be384c3b18915461f19c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19620","senseId":"1","lemma":"강우량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서울","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔","readings":[{"term":"서울","audio":"/audio/ca6c419327ce5a9d7e62.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"팔십","meaning":"八十","explanation":"팔십：八十","readings":[{"term":"팔십","audio":"/audio/97108fcb6a0f17706307.mp3"}],"